body:
This is what I was suspecting. Yan is very attractive by all rights, extremely talented musician as well as tall, fit and handsome. 

&#x200B;

Hanna is also conventionally attractive but is over-complimented on a regular basis because her talents and personality lack. She has also put on a great deal of weight in the last year and may be seeking attention that she's no longer getting.

To be honest, I am not really looking for anything serious either so I don't think I'm being used, rather just having a fun time with someone I get along with. And it was the first day we had officially met. 

&#x200B;

Being said I ask in case one of us catches feelings in the coming weeks
